  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>A larger version of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vibroblade\" title=\"Vibroblade\">Vibroblade</a> that first came into service during <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Great_Sith_War\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Great Sith War\">The Great Sith War</a>, the Dire Vibroblade is merely a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vibroblade\" title=\"Vibroblade\">Vibroblade</a> with a larger hilt, making it easier to wield in two hands (thus allowing Medium characters to gain double their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> bonus to damage with the weapon). </p><p>A Dire Vibroblade requires an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Energy_Cell\" title=\"Energy Cell\">Energy Cell</a> to operate. </p>",
